              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">Jul 2015 – Jan 2018</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-600">Jawaharlal Nehru Technological University, Hyderabad, India</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mt-1">GPA: 8.27/10.0</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="mb-1 flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-1">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">B.Tech. in Computer Science and Engineering</h3>
